{"overview":"در حالی که آخرین شب مشترک خود را جشن می‌گیرند، فارغ‌التحصیلان دبیرستان و بهترین دوستان جو و رائسا به درگاهی مرموز می‌رسند که آن‌ها را به جزیرهٔ خیال‌انگیز ناکالی می‌برد؛ وقتی می‌فهمند که خاطرات تمام دوستی‌شان بهای بازگشت به خانه است، جو و رائسا باید پیش از آنکه برای همیشه یکدیگر را فراموش کنند، راهی برای ترک جزیره پیدا کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.","tagline_en":"No memory left behind.","runtime":109,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Januel Mercado","جوئل کرافورد"],"crew_en":["Januel Mercado","Joel Crawford"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"H.E.R.","role":"Jo (voice)","photo":"/3OgApAmRJF6Y79HyHS1BZjNMgZd.jpg"},{"name":"لیزا سوبرانو","role":"Raissa (voice)","photo":"/xsgT139b39OHdLkY87yIabNLi5Y.jpg","en":"Liza Soberano"},{"name":"دیو فرانکو","role":"Raww (voice)","photo":"/to7ee1xcCOpDSKMXjBIRuYEfbEc.jpg","en":"Dave Franco"},{"name":"جنی اسلیت","role":"Batiba (voice)","photo":"/mMxsNO6r966ut0sordYzj2iDOb6.jpg","en":"Jenny Slate"},{"name":"منی جاسینتو","role":"Bungi Tiyanak (voice)","photo":"/jMbNV4nr5647r6CZJbT6nsnspMz.jpg","en":"Manny Jacinto"},{"name":"Lea Salonga","role":"Manang (voice)","photo":"/cA8lv5GCU5DkZMEeplaVgttrlXr.jpg"},{"name":"دالی دی لئون","role":"Lola (voice)","photo":"/fwwvPAJaJA3F8P35MYGf8MmYfe8.jpg","en":"Dolly de Leon"},{"name":"Jo Koy","role":"Datu (voice)","photo":"/rbD9UnkYFYsmewSn2YFPI8lL5UI.jpg"},{"name":"رونی چنگ","role":"King Truffle Wuffle (voice)","photo":"/yRUGjqALyg1LcJO75cO58cVJ2ud.jpg","en":"Ronny Chieng"},{"name":"Kevin McCann","role":"Prince Mermahn (voice)","photo":"/tY9R5lQyA0vI7Bz6COiyyzOtkqJ.jpg"},{"name